---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: onlyLegion OR withAuthorization(signature)
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenNotPaused, whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard2 --> q_guard3: whenSaleEnded, whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guard3 --> q_guard4: whenSaleResultsNotPublished
    q_guard4 --> q_verifyTransfer: _verifyCanTransferInvestorPosition(positionId)
    q_verifyTransfer --> q_checkTo: to == address(0)?
    q_checkTo --> q_burn: to == address(0) - burn position
    q_checkTo --> q_transfer: to != address(0) - transfer position
    q_burn --> q_clearPos: delete s_investorPositions[from]
    q_clearPos --> [*]: position burned
    q_transfer --> q_checkExisting: s_investorPositions[to].positionId exists?
    q_checkExisting --> q_merge: existing position - merge capital
    q_checkExisting --> q_newPos: no existing position - move position
    q_merge --> q_updateTo: s_investorPositions[to].capitalInvested += from.capitalInvested
    q_updateTo --> q_clearFrom: delete s_investorPositions[from]
    q_clearFrom --> [*]: positions merged
    q_newPos --> q_movePos: s_investorPositions[to] = s_investorPositions[from]
    q_movePos --> q_clearOld: delete s_investorPositions[from]
    q_clearOld --> [*]: position transferred

    note right of q_guard4
        INV-001: Transfer blocked after sale results published
        INV-002: Position must not have refunded or settled
    end note

    note right of q_merge
        INV-003: Merging positions combines capital but must preserve accounting
        INV-004: Authorization signature required for non-Legion transfers
    end note
